A module whose whole surface is declared in JSON syntax (outputs.tf.json and
variables.tf.json). The consumer's reference to the declared bucket_arn is
clean; the reference to bucket_name, which the JSON module does not declare,
is reported.
-- modules/bucket/outputs.tf.json --
{"output": {"bucket_arn": {"value": "x"}}}
-- modules/bucket/variables.tf.json --
{"variable": {"bucket_prefix": {"type": "string"}}}
-- storage/bucket/terragrunt.hcl --
terraform {
  source = "../../modules/bucket"
}

inputs = {
  bucket_prefix = "golden"
}
-- storage/consumer/terragrunt.hcl --
dependency "bucket" {
  config_path = "../bucket"
}

inputs = {
  arn  = dependency.bucket.outputs.bucket_arn
  name = dependency.bucket.outputs.bucket_name
}
-- _golden/exit --
1
-- _golden/want --
# storage/consumer/terragrunt.hcl line 7: "  name = " is 9 bytes.
GRT001 error storage/consumer/terragrunt.hcl:7:10 storage/consumer
